  "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\"><head><title>404 · 작은손 커피공방</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/littlehands/app.3539de012f0c.css\"></head>\n<body data-app=\"little-hands\" data-environment=\"staging\"><header class=\"site-header\" data-native-key=\"site-header\" data-native-type=\"surface\"><div class=\"wrap header-inner\"><div class=\"brand\" data-native-key=\"brand-stack\"><a class=\"brand-link\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"작은손 커피공방 홈\" data-native-key=\"brand\" data-native-type=\"control\" data-action=\"home\">작은손 커피공방</a><small data-native-key=\"brand-tagline\" data-native-type=\"text\">커피를 배우는 작은 시간</small></div><nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"회원 메뉴\"><a href=\"/\" data-action=\"sessions\" data-native-key=\"nav-sessions\" data-native-type=\"control\">수업 둘러보기</a><a href=\"/bookings/\" data-action=\"bookings\" data-native-key=\"nav-bookings\" data-native-type=\"control\">나의 예약</a><a href=\"/notifications/\" data-action=\"notifications\" data-native-key=\"nav-notifications\" data-native-type=\"control\">알림 5</a><form inert data-export-only=\"true\" method=\"post\"><button class=\"text-button\" data-action=\"logout\" data-native-key=\"nav-logout\" data-native-type=\"control\" type=\"button\">로그아웃</button></form></nav></div></header>\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"page \" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"auth\"><p class=\"kicker\" data-native-key=\"404-p-1-0\" data-native-type=\"text\">404</p><h1 data-native-key=\"error-title\" data-native-type=\"text\">페이지를 찾을 수 없어요.</h1><p data-native-key=\"error-message\" data-native-type=\"text\">주소를 확인하거나 수업 목록에서 다시 시작해 주세요.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"/\" data-action=\"sessions\" data-native-key=\"error-home\" data-native-type=\"control\">수업 목록으로</a></div></div></div></main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\" data-native-key=\"site-footer\" data-native-type=\"surface\"><div class=\"wrap footer-inner\"><p data-native-key=\"base-p-2-0\" data-native-type=\"text\"><strong>작은손 커피공방</strong><br>수업의 작은 시작부터, 나만의 한 잔까지.</p><p data-native-key=\"base-p-3-0\" data-native-type=\"text\">수업료는 현장에서 결제합니다.<br><span class=\"environment\">staging 환경</span></p></div></footer>\n</body><div id=\"codex-browser-sidebar-comments-root\"></div></html>",
